From: "Ryan X. Charles" <ryan@ryanxcharles.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 08:08:35 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Bundle common languages in RedVim

Ten grammars move beneath one roof,
With colored tokens offering proof.
Make keeps its tabs, the queries stay,
No parser errands on install day.
